    "body": "## Problem\n\nWith multicursor active, an Insert-mode expr mapping sees `v:count` = 1 (fixes #42493). The cascade replays the entry command (`i`) at each cursor inside the replay sandbox, which sets `v:count`, and `mc_sandbox_leave()` doesn't restore it.\n\n## Solution\n\nSave `v:count`, `v:count1` and `v:prevcount` in `mc_sandbox_enter()` and restore them in `mc_sandbox_leave()`, like the other primary-cursor state. Added a test to mcursor_spec using the mapping from the issue. It fails on master (`1Hello`) and passes with this change. mcursor_spec, cmdatom_spec, count_spec and mode_normal_spec pass locally.\n\nAI-assisted: the code and test were written mainly by an AI agent on my behalf.\n",
